(3412056, 476043, 57378, '<td valign="top">Theres my winner - Great shot. Very striking. My only gripe would be the crop of the far left of the tree - Was there something else there that made you crop to the branch? Very nice though.<br/>Jeff</td>', 'Theres my winner - Great shot. Very striking. My only gripe would be the crop of the far left of the tree - Was there something else there that made you crop to the branch? Very nice though.Jeff', '2007-02-28 02:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
