(3412702, 476557, 49109, '<td valign="top">nice idea, not so well executed: the silver color is too obvious;  there should be frost on the glass and can, too; you should have focused on the hand, glass and can instead of including the irrelevant background and shoulder; the crop at top and right is far too close to the main subjects. the icicle is much too large in relation to the glass</td>', 'nice idea, not so well executed: the silver color is too obvious;  there should be frost on the glass and can, too; you should have focused on the hand, glass and can instead of including the irrelevant background and shoulder; the crop at top and right is far too close to the main subjects. the icicle is much too large in relation to the glass', '2007-02-28 07:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
