(3414288, 473677, 35357, '<td valign="top">I went to Carleton U. and I used to skate from the far side of Dow''s Lake to Landsdown Park to go to The Beer Store.  Often from end to end to go to the bars in The Market.  I think I got the names right, it''s been a long time, was back in the late 80''s.  Wonderful memories, it''s a joy to see this shot.  I''ll have to show my wife, we had our first date skating on the canal in 1985!<br/> <br/>I sure hope this is the Rideau Canal.  If I''m wrong.... OOPS! :-)</td>', 'I went to Carleton U. and I used to skate from the far side of Dow''s Lake to Landsdown Park to go to The Beer Store.  Often from end to end to go to the bars in The Market.  I think I got the names right, it''s been a long time, was back in the late 80''s.  Wonderful memories, it''s a joy to see this shot.  I''ll have to show my wife, we had our first date skating on the canal in 1985! I sure hope this is the Rideau Canal.  If I''m wrong.... OOPS! :-)', '2007-02-28 14:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
