(3415963, 476122, 74371, '<td valign="top">I think you could have made this with a little more contrast or shadow to bring out the chess pieces more. They seem to recede into the picture instead of being a main focal point. I am not sure HOW I would have done this picture in as small of a space as a freezer, but maybe without the full wattage of the fridge light and maybe a small spot on the chess pieces.... I don''t know. I like the idea of the shot... just a litle too washed out for my tastes. Nice thought though!</td>', 'I think you could have made this with a little more contrast or shadow to bring out the chess pieces more. They seem to recede into the picture instead of being a main focal point. I am not sure HOW I would have done this picture in as small of a space as a freezer, but maybe without the full wattage of the fridge light and maybe a small spot on the chess pieces.... I don''t know. I like the idea of the shot... just a litle too washed out for my tastes. Nice thought though!', '2007-02-28 23:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
