(3420959, 476560, 62637, '<td valign="top">a very cool photo that is going to be hurt by its size.  If you have photoshop, be sure to resize to 640px then use "save for web" to accurately control the size of your saved image.  Otherwise, download a free program like google picasa, which has similar control over image size and quality.  PM me if you have any questions, this really is a cool photo and I hate to see it suffer just cause its too small.</td>', 'a very cool photo that is going to be hurt by its size.  If you have photoshop, be sure to resize to 640px then use "save for web" to accurately control the size of your saved image.  Otherwise, download a free program like google picasa, which has similar control over image size and quality.  PM me if you have any questions, this really is a cool photo and I hate to see it suffer just cause its too small.', '2007-03-01 22:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
