(3424815, 476845, 68035, '<td valign="top">I love the lower right ice crystal.  Because the two in the upper left are not of the same ''quality'' as this my personal feeling is they distract from the overall impact.  The spotting especially in the lower left and upper right is a bit of a shame.  Fantastic photo though.</td>', 'I love the lower right ice crystal.  Because the two in the upper left are not of the same ''quality'' as this my personal feeling is they distract from the overall impact.  The spotting especially in the lower left and upper right is a bit of a shame.  Fantastic photo though.', '2007-03-03 02:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3424928, 474369, 20056, '<td valign="top">first entry?</td>', 'first entry?', '2007-03-03 05:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
