(3424978, 475053, 41554, '<td valign="top">Very nice sky. I whish the ice was a bit sharper (no pun intended). The blurring on the bottom left is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Very nice sky. I whish the ice was a bit sharper (no pun intended). The blurring on the bottom left is a bit distracting.', '2007-03-03 05:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3424980, 475326, 41554, '<td valign="top">This gives me the shivers. Great "icy" feel and clarity. Beautiful shot.</td>', 'This gives me the shivers. Great "icy" feel and clarity. Beautiful shot.', '2007-03-03 05:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3424984, 475871, 41554, '<td valign="top">I can''t help but feel that you just missed a ribbon-winning shot. Please note, your shot is still great, but I feel the composition could be a lot better. <br/>The ice textures in the left are simply stunning, and a closer, macro-type shot of this alone would probably get a 10 from me. The stick with the bit of ice is distracting, as are the differences in the ice textures left/right. I also would have cropped out the top, or perhaps try a b/w conversion.<br/>I don''t know the constraints you had to take this, and probably there was nothing you could do to better it. But I can''t help the "could have been a ribbon but..." feel.</td>', 'I can''t help but feel that you just missed a ribbon-winning shot. Please note, your shot is still great, but I feel the composition could be a lot better. The ice textures in the left are simply stunning, and a closer, macro-type shot of this alone would probably get a 10 from me. The stick with the bit of ice is distracting, as are the differences in the ice textures left/right. I also would have cropped out the top, or perhaps try a b/w conversion.I don''t know the constraints you had to take this, and probably there was nothing you could do to better it. But I can''t help the "could have been a ribbon but..." feel.', '2007-03-03 06:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3424985, 475632, 41554, '<td valign="top">Oi, that looks painful!!</td>', 'Oi, that looks painful!!', '2007-03-03 06:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3424986, 474155, 41554, '<td valign="top">Nice sky / reflection. Could be a bit sharper on the ice parts.</td>', 'Nice sky / reflection. Could be a bit sharper on the ice parts.', '2007-03-03 06:03:10.000000', NULL, 1);
