(3424991, 476623, 41554, '<td valign="top">This is one of the shots in this challenge that gives me the shivers. Brrr. Good, a bit dull perhaps. If the "fellows" were a bit closer, I think it would be more interesting.</td>', 'This is one of the shots in this challenge that gives me the shivers. Brrr. Good, a bit dull perhaps. If the "fellows" were a bit closer, I think it would be more interesting.', '2007-03-03 06:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
