(3429767, 473376, 36065, '<td valign="top">The colors that you captured are tremendous, but the sky is a bit too bright for your subject.  My eye is drawn directly to the washed out portion of the sky and held there.  Perhaps a graduated ND filter would have helped and made this one near-flawless.  Even positioning the ice spire more over teh bright spot would have helped a bit.</td>', 'The colors that you captured are tremendous, but the sky is a bit too bright for your subject.  My eye is drawn directly to the washed out portion of the sky and held there.  Perhaps a graduated ND filter would have helped and made this one near-flawless.  Even positioning the ice spire more over teh bright spot would have helped a bit.', '2007-03-05 06:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
