(3449260, 475983, 1031, '<td valign="top">You''ve definitely captured the feeling of "cold" -- I can imagine a lot of people being picky because -- between the running water, plants, and snow -- there''s only a little actual ice showing.<br/> <br/>Also, to me, the way you''ve cropped at/below the horizon makes it look as though the image is tilted a bit to the right (clockwise).</td>', 'You''ve definitely captured the feeling of "cold" -- I can imagine a lot of people being picky because -- between the running water, plants, and snow -- there''s only a little actual ice showing. Also, to me, the way you''ve cropped at/below the horizon makes it look as though the image is tilted a bit to the right (clockwise).', '2007-03-10 18:59:44.000000', NULL, 0),
